sequenceDiagram
    participant ModelStorage as Model Storage<br/>(S3/GCS/Azure/PVC)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant StorageInit as KServe Storage<br/>Initializer<br/>(Init Container)
    participant SharedVol as /mnt/models<br/>(Shared Volume)
    participant AutoGluon as autogluonserver<br/>8080/TCP HTTP<br/>8081/TCP gRPC
    participant DataPlane as KServe Data Plane<br/>(Istio/Knative/Gateway)
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over StorageInit,SharedVol: Pod Startup - Model Loading

    StorageInit->>ModelStorage: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Cloud IAM / SA token
    ModelStorage-->>StorageInit: Model files
    StorageInit->>SharedVol: Write model to /mnt/models

    Note over AutoGluon: Container Start

    AutoGluon->>AutoGluon: runtime_paths: set writable cwd
    AutoGluon->>SharedVol: Load model directory
    AutoGluon->>AutoGluon: version_compat: check version
    AutoGluon->>AutoGluon: Auto-detect: TimeSeriesPredictor<br/>or TabularPredictor

    Note over Client,AutoGluon: Inference Request (v1 JSON)

    Client->>DataPlane: POST /v1/models/{name}:predict<br/>JSON payload
    DataPlane->>AutoGluon: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8080
    AutoGluon-->>DataPlane: Prediction result (JSON)
    DataPlane-->>Client: Response

    Note over Client,AutoGluon: Inference Request (v2 Tensor - Tabular only)

    Client->>DataPlane: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer<br/>Tensor payload
    DataPlane->>AutoGluon: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8080
    AutoGluon-->>DataPlane: Tensor response
    DataPlane-->>Client: Response

    Note over Client,AutoGluon: gRPC Inference

    Client->>DataPlane: gRPC ModelInfer
    DataPlane->>AutoGluon: Forward<br/>gRPC/8081
    AutoGluon-->>DataPlane: InferResponse
    DataPlane-->>Client: Response

    Note over Prom,AutoGluon: Metrics Collection

    Prom->>AutoGluon: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP/8080
    AutoGluon-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
